SamIAm wrote:
>
> I mean, it's not readily apparent what my goal is.

The stated goal at the beginning of the game it to hand over the
amulet to your diety.  So start looking for an altar to your
diety.  Hint, the word "planes" is plural for a reason and this
is only the first of them.

> I've been digging
> all sorts of tunnels, but there's no clear indicator as to what my
> intention should be, other than to simply stay alive and hang on to
> the Amulet.  Advice?

Start looking for a way to get to the next level.  Each level has a
portal to the next.  Each level is harder than the previous and each
has a set of tricks that make it easier.  In a sense, it's just like
every previous run in Nethack - The goal of *this* game is to learn
what to do and what not to do in future games.  In this one you
have learned so far that preparation for the first level includes lots
of digging, or learning how to find the portal so you don't have to
dig out the entire level to find your way to the next.  Sure enough
the next level will have a similar set of challenges.



